## IAM & Security
- Use IAM roles for identity-based access — never access keys or hardcoded credentials
- VPC endpoints for private connectivity (e.g., `aws_vpc_endpoint_service_configuration`):
  <!-- {{PRIVATE_ENDPOINT_PATTERN}} — example: vpc_endpoint_ids = [aws_vpc_endpoint.default.id] -->
- `{{PRIVATE_ENDPOINT_PATTERN}}` — use VPC endpoints for private connectivity
- Enable encryption at rest (`kms_key_id` or `server_side_encryption_configuration`) by default
- `block_public_access` enabled on S3 buckets by default

## No hardcoded secrets, account IDs, or credentials in module code. Use IAM roles and AWS Secrets Manager.
